<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>V. Monishwar Reddy  | Portfolio</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #0e0140, #004e92);
      color: #f0f0f0;
    }

    header {
      background: #0b0c10;
      padding: 20px 40px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 999;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #00c6ff;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #fff;
      margin: 0 15px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #00ffd9;
    }

    .hero {
      background: #6e6d6d; /* Fallback */
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      height: 100vh; /* Full viewport height */
      width: 100vw; /* Full viewport width */
      text-align: left;
      position: relative;
      padding: 40px 60px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .slideshow-container {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      height: 100vh;
      width: 100%;
      z-index: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .slide {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;

      object-fit: cover;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;
    }

    .slide.active {
      opacity: 1; /* Set this to your preferred opacity */
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      max-width: 500px;
      color: #fff;
      z-index: 1;
      text-align: absolute;
    }

    .hero-content h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .hero-content p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin: 5px 0;
    }

    .resume-button {
      background: #00ffd9;
      color: #000;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 20px;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .resume-button:hover {
      background: #0ff;
    }

    section {
      padding: 60px 20px;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    section h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: #00ffd9;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .card, .card-grid .card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    .card-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      max-height: 300px; /* Fixed height */

      object-fit: Cover;

      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      background: None; 
      padding: 0; /* Optional padding inside the white box */
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto 10px auto;
      
    }
    .tedis-img {
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
       /* you can adjust this to make it bigger */
      object-fit: contain;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto 10px auto;
      background-color: #fff; /* optional for logos */
      padding: 8px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    /* Make all Experience section images equal size */
    #Experience .card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 200px;
      object-fit: contain;
      background-color: #fff;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    #publications .card-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 5px;
    }

    #publications .card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      padding: 8px 10px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      transition: transform 0.3s;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    #publications .card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      background: transparent;
    }

    #conferences .card img {
      height: auto !important;
      max-height: 200px !important;
      object-fit: contain !important;
      background-color: #fff;
    }
    #hackathons .card-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    #hackathons .card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      transition: transform 0.3s;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      max-width: 300px;                   /* Set max width for uniformity */
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    #hackathons .card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 180px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .card strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #00ffd9;
    }

    .card a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 6px;
      color: #00ffd9;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .card a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
      color: #00c6ff;
    }
    #newsletter .card {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .newsletter-button {
      background-color: #000011;
      color: #00ffd9;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      display: inline-block;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* Contact Form Styles */
    .contact-form-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 198, 255, 0.1), rgba(0, 255, 217, 0.05));
      border: 2px solid rgba(0, 255, 217, 0.2);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 255, 217, 0.15);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .contact-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .contact-header i {
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: #00ffd9;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .contact-header h3 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      color: #00ffd9;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .contact-header p {
      color: #b0b0b0;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .contact-form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .form-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .form-group label {
      color: #00ffd9;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .form-group label i {
      margin-right: 8px;
    }

    .form-group input,
    .form-group textarea {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 2px solid rgba(0, 255, 217, 0.3);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px 15px;
      color: #f0f0f0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    }

    .form-group input:focus,
    .form-group textarea:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: #00ffd9;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 255, 217, 0.2);
    }

    .form-group input::placeholder,
    .form-group textarea::placeholder {
      color: #888;
    }

    .form-group textarea {
      resize: vertical;
      min-height: 120px;
    }

    .submit-btn {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00ffd9, #00c6ff);
      color: #000;
      border: none;
      padding: 15px 30px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      margin-top: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .submit-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 255, 217, 0.4);
    }

    .submit-btn i {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    footer {
      background: #0b0c10;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #aaa;
    }

    section.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
      transition: opacity 0.6s ease-out, transform 0.6s ease-out;
    }

    section:not(.visible) {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(40px);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      header {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 15px;
        margin-top: 10px;
      }

      .hero-content h1 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }

      .hero-content p {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .card-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .tedis-img {
        height: 100px;
        width: auto;
        object-fit: contain;
        display: block;
        margin: 0 auto 10px auto;
        background-color: transparent;
      }

      .contact-form-card {
        padding: 25px;
      }

      .contact-header h3 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
      }

      .submit-btn {
        font-size: 1rem;
        padding: 12px 25px;
      }
    }
    
  </style>
  <script>
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      document.querySelectorAll('section').forEach(section => {
        const top = section.getBoundingClientRect().top;
        const threshold = window.innerHeight * 0.85;
        if (top < threshold) {
          section.classList.add('visible');
        }
      });
    });

  </script>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Monishwar Reddy</h1>
    <nav>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#Experience">Experience</a>
      <a href="#hackathons">Hackathons</a>
      <a href="#newsletter">Newsletter</a>
      <a href="#publications">Publications</a>
      <a href="#conferences">Conferences</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="slideshow-container">
    <img class="slide" src="monishwar-1.jpg" alt="Slide 1" />
    <img class="slide" src="monishwares-2.jpeg" alt="Slide 2" />
    <img class="slide" src="monishwar-3.jpeg" alt="Slide 3" />
    <img class="slide" src="monishwar-4.jpeg" alt="Slide 4" />
    <img class="slide" src="monishwar-5.jpeg" alt="Slide 5" />
    <img class="slide" src="monishwar-6.jpeg" alt="Slide 6" />
    </div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Monishwar Reddy Vardireddy</h1>
      <p>Student, Woxsen University</p>
      <a href="Resume (2).pdf" class="resume-button" download>Download My Resume</a>
    </div>

  </section>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <div class="card">
      Hi, I’m Monishwar Reddy Vardireddy, currently pursuing B.Tech at Woxsen University, specializing in Computer Science. I’m deeply passionate about the intersection of technology, research, and sustainability. Over the years, I’ve explored a wide range of domains such as data analysis, biomedical signal processing and EEG-based research. My work as a Research Assistant and Intern has allowed me to contribute to impactful projects like mathematical modelling, Monte Carlo simulations, and myocardial infarction detection.
      I've also contributed to global leadership and tech diplomacy through initiatives like TEDIS MUNs, which connects students worldwide to explore sustainable solutions through innovation and dialogue. I’m always eager to take on new challenges where I can apply my skills to real-world problems and drive meaningful impact.
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="Experience">
    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
