        <strong>Research Assistant – Woxsen University</strong><br>
        SEIR, Monte Carlo model Analysis.
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="dowmload-2.jpeg" alt="Intern" class="fix-bg">
        <strong>Research Intern – Woxsen University</strong><br>
        EEG/HMI Research and Publications.
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="downloads-3.jpg" alt="HCL" class="fix-bg">
        <strong>Biomedical Signal Processing Intern – HCL Tech</strong><br>
        Myocardial Infarction Detection .
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="downloads-4.jpg" alt="TEDIS" class="tedis-img">
        <strong>Founder – TEDIS Foundation</strong><br><br>
        Global MUN Conferences on Diplomacy and Technology.<br>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/tedis-foundation/" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a><br>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/tedis_foundation?igsh=MXhwdDZobXM3c2RqcA==" target="_blank">Instagram</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="downloads-5.jpg" alt="Tiaano">
        <strong>R&D Analyst Intern – Tiaano</strong><br>
