    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="newsletter">
    <h2>Newsletter</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <p>Stay updated with my latest work and thoughts!</p>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/newsletters/7280177177575223296/" target="_blank" class="newsletter-button">Follow My LinkedIn Newsletter</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="hackathons">
    <h2>Hackathons</h2>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <img src="hackback.jpeg" alt="Hackathon 1">
        <strong>Udhgam 2025 DigiTech Hackathon – 3rd Prize</strong><br>
        We built a Ticketing Platform to Help Small Event Organizers With Sales, Payments, and Check-Ins.
        <a href="Hack-1.jpeg" target="_blank">View Certificate</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="kiro-hackathon.jpg" alt="Code with Kiro Hackathon">
        <strong>Code with Kiro Hackathon</strong><br>
        My project was "AI Tutor" - an educational web application that demonstrates the power of AI-assisted learning. It allows users to paste code, problems, or any text content, and instantly receive step-by-step explanations. The system breaks down complex concepts into easy, digestible insights, helping learners understand programming topics more effectively.
        <a href="kiro-certificate.jpg" target="_blank">View Certificate</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="publications">
    <h2>Publications</h2>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <img src="plastic-paper.png" alt="Plastic Waste Pyrolysis">
        <strong>Various Methods for Plastic Waste Pyrolysis to Fuels: A Review</strong><br>
        <a href="https://journals.stmjournals.com/jopc/article=2025/view=215242/" target="_blank">View Paper</a><br>
        Journal of Polymer and Composites, 2025.
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="eeg-neuromarketing.png" alt="EEG in Neuromarketing">
        <strong>Integrating EEG Analysis to Illuminate Consumer Behavior and Optimize Marketing Strategies</strong>
        <a href="http://www.igi-global.com/chapter/integrating-eeg-analysis-to-illuminate-consumer-behavior-and-optimize-marketing-strategies/365521" target="_blank">View Chapter</a><br>
        IGI Global – Quantum AI Neuromarketing.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="conferences">
    <h2>Conferences</h2>
    <h3 style="text-align:center; color:#00ffd9; margin-top:30px;">Research Conferences</h3>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
