        <strong>HICMUN2024</strong><br>
        Represented Gleeson Hedge in the Heroes of Olympus Committee and received an Honorable Mention.<br>
        <a href="HICMUN2024cert.jpeg" target="_blank">View Certificate</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="GDS2025.png" alt="GDS2025">
